    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 19.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf se ðonne byrste, nime ðonne leafe ge heonan ge ðeonan þæt he mote hæntan æfter [his] agan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if this summons fails, he shall get leave, either from the one court or the other, to take his own measures for the recovery of his property.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf se þonne berste, nime þonne leafe ægþer ge heonan ge þanan, þæt he mote hentan æfter his agenan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
